        "text_T9tDC7": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Welcome to Diamond School, the Anna Sheffield guide to what are quite possibly the most appealing and mysterious of the earth’s ancient, alchemical materials—diamonds and gemstones.</p><p>From the fundamentals of the 4Cs and the search for flawless beauty, to the delightful balance of perfectly-imperfect diamonds, we hope this guide to precious gems and fine jewelry will help to inform and empower you as you seek out stones that are uniquely meaningful to you—and perfect for your love.</p>",
